{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Combat｜近战判定流程\n结构见 [[GGYGO_结构_Combat.canvas|结构图]]；伤害后续见 [[GGYGO_流程_伤害结算.canvas]]。\n02a 完整构建及冷启动近战自动化通过，无错误/警告；验证边界见 [[Combat/结构]]。真实动画接入待验收。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1710,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "open",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. GA 校验当前 Montage/播放实例/主 Mesh，混出后拒绝 Begin。\nBeginTraceWindow 校验 Socket/半径/预算，无效保持关闭；有效时重置去重和基线。\nBossMelee 忽略重复 Begin，不清当前命中集合。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 392,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "baseline",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2. 窗口首帧只记录武器两端位置，不生成从旧动画到新动画的虚假扫掠。\n\n调用：MeleeTrace::PerformTrace 首次仅记录 Mesh::GetSocketLocation 两端，避免跨窗口虚假命中。",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 392,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "sweep",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3. PerformTrace 按长度/半径确定分段数，逐点 SweepMultiByChannel。\n查询请求 PhysicalMaterial；需求超过 MaxTraceSegments 时关闭并告警。\n按帧间直线近似；大角度旋转仍有误差。",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 392,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "dedupe",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "4. 查 HitActorsThisWindow；新 Actor 入集合后 OnMeleeHit.Broadcast。\n广播返回检查 bIsTracing/WindowSerial；关闭或重开立即退出旧查询，禁止写回旧基线。",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": 392,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "ge",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "5. GA 把 HitResult、目标与命中时源位置交给共享 BuildHitEffectPayload。\n\n共享路径生成 Context/Spec/Cue；GA 填 SetByCaller、尝试应用 GE，并在碰撞成立后独立执行 Cue。",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": 918,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "close",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "6. NotifyEnd、BlendOut、EndAbility、Deactivate、OnUnregister 或 EndPlay → EndTraceWindow。\n幂等关闭 Tick并清端点、基线和去重；活动窗口递增 WindowSerial。\nGA 最终结束还须解绑委托、恢复 Mesh 与释放自有任务/位移句柄。",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 972,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "1"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "e1",
      "fromNode": "open",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "baseline",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "开启窗口"
    },
    {
      "id": "e2",
      "fromNode": "baseline",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "sweep",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "基线有效"
    },
    {
      "id": "e3",
      "fromNode": "sweep",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "dedupe",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "获得命中候选"
    },
    {
      "id": "e4",
      "fromNode": "dedupe",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "ge",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "首次命中"
    },
    {
      "id": "e5",
      "fromNode": "ge",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "close",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "动画窗口结束"
    },
    {
      "id": "e6",
      "fromNode": "dedupe",
      "fromSide": "left",
      "toNode": "sweep",
      "toSide": "right",
      "label": "下一帧继续"
    }
  ]
}
